ata-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr323"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas07p7ld/"></a>1-й этап</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr324/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="324" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr324"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasxhkhyw/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="2" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr325/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="325" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr325"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasb4ymep/"></a>Соискатель права пользования участком недр (заявитель)</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr326/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="326" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr326"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas87kmmu/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr327/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="327" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr327"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasgok1du/"></a>Подготавливает документы, необходимые для получения лицензии на право пользования участком недр.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr328/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="328" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr328"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasim6bw6/"></a>Подает заявку в соответствующий орган, уполномоченный выдавать лицензии на право пользования участками недр</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr329/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="329" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr329"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasnz8k3g/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="2" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr330/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="330" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr330"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfaskla3x7/"></a>По усмотрению соискателя</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr331/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="331" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr331"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasag2mx0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr332/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="332" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr332"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas2rec39/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr333/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="333" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr333"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas0k3u6q/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr334/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="334" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr334"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasze4gkc/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr335/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="335" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr335"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasbc9c6y/"></a>&#160;</td><td valign="middle"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr336/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="336" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr336"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfaskiu6gr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anc