e"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr345/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="345" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr345"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasmox9dt/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr346/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="346" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr346"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas7zgynw/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr347/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="347" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr347"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasvpzazi/"></a>&#160;</td><td valign="middle" class="bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr348/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="348" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr348"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas4t3xth/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr349/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="349" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr349"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas03q88s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr350/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="350" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr350"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas6dvsny/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr351/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="351" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr351"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas0mieoy/"></a>&#160;</td><td valign="middle" class="bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr352/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="352" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr352"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas2or6o1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top" align="center"><td rowspan="13" class="bdLeft bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr353/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="353" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr353"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas2lzp8z/"></a>2-й этап</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr354/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="354" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr354"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasf0d4h5/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr355/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="355" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr355"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfast1796p/"></a>Орган, уполномоченный выдавать лицензии на право пользования участками недр</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr356/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="356" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr356"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas75wcgy/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr357/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="357" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr357"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasotg37g/"></a>Рассматривает заявку и принимает решение о принятии или мотивированном отказе в ее приеме</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr358/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="358" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr358"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas97odmx/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="7" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr359/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="359" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr359"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasglw0bz/"></a>20 дней, а заявки на выдачу лицензии для сбора образцов камнесамоцветного сырья, палеонтологических остатков и других геологических коллекционных материалов &#8212; в течение 10 дней</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr360/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="360" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr360"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfascwo9b5/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr361/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="361" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr361"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas407g46/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr362/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="362" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr362"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasddaqdl/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr363/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="363" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr363"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasim3q29/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr364/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="364" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr364"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasu82tt7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr365/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="365" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase