asdesy02/"></a>Госкомгеологии (по углеводородному сырью &#8212; совместно с АО &#171;Узбекнефтегаз&#187;), а по участкам недр, предоставляемым в пользование для строительства и эксплуатации подземных сооружений для хранения и захоронения отходов &#8212; Госкомэкологии</p></td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr381/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="381" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr381"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasmsvlxl/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr382/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="382" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr382"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasl4qdum/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr383/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="383" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr383"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasrspdxn/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr384/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="384" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr384"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasrvn2ps/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr385/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="385" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr385"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasu81ygg/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr386/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="386" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr386"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfash1kqi9/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr387/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="387" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr387"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas9fpw4g