favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr424"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas85cp4u/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr425/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="425" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr425"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasp4wmgx/"></a>30 дней, а по крупным и наиболее сложным объектам &#8212; 60 дней со дня поступления материалов</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr426/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="426" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr426"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfashsbuts/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr427/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="427" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr427"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasx1d3nc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr428/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="428" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr428"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasai13i1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr429/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="429" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr429"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas3i9wmx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr430/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="430" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr430"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasehnd6g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr431/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="431" data-dwh-source-type-fav