sPhr567/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="567" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr567"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfaslo4cz1/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="5" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr568/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="568" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasvulntg/"></a>По результатам экспертизы вносит необходимые коррективы в УТЭР и (или) &#8212; ПТЭО и направляет их на согласование в органы, выполнившие экспертизу, а в случае положительного заключения экспертизы представляет материалы в Госкомгеологии</p></td><td class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas0egawc/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" valign="middle" align="center" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfash9oh97/"></a>В согласованные сроки</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasot4kvy/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasqx7y4t/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="573" data-dwh-source-