ериалы и в случае их соответствия установленным условиям пользования участком недр принимает решение о выдаче лицензии</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr668/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="668" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr668"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasg94hu3/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr669/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="669" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr669"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasp956px/"></a>30 дней</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr670/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="670" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr670"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas6d7l23/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr671/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="671" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr671"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfash26du8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr672/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="672" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr672"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasvr9sk7/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr673/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="673" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr673"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfask3g6t0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr674/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="674" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr674"></a><a d