data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr682"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfaszt0usu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr683/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="683" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr683"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfaslpakzm/"></a>&#160;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr684/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="684" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr684"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas9wd0qe/"></a>&#160;</td><td valign="middle" class="bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr685/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="685" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr685"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas2e64lh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr valign="top" align="center"><td rowspan="9" class="bdLeft bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr686/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="686" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr686"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasly2iyu/"></a>8-й этап</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr687/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="687" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr687"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfashaghxm/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr688/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="688" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr688"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasd8ghzh/"></a>Госкомгеологии</p><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr689/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="689" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr689"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfas0rby3r/"></a>Госкомэкологии</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr690/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="690" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr690"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasa85tib/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="9" align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr691/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="691" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr691"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasi436g6/"></a>На основании решения Кабинета Министров Республики Узбекистан соответствующий орган, уполномоченный выдавать лицензии, оформляет и выдает лицензию на право пользования участком недр.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr692/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="692" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr692"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasihqmgu/"></a>После выдачи лицензии пользователю недр реализуется полный пакет геологической и иной информации по участку недр, предоставленному в пользование, для разработки в установленном порядке окончательного технико-экономического обоснования по пользованию участком недр</p></td><td align="left" class="bdRight bdBottom"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr693/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="693" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr693"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasom2emc/"></a>&#160;</td><td rowspan="4" valign="middle" class="bdRight bdBottom"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/bssPhr694/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="694" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr694"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4098/dfasa9gomg/"></a>30 дней</p></td></tr><tr val